      <bpmn:task id="Bridge_4_ae26" name="Here is a transition sentence connecting Process A and Process B, followed by the integrated business process design you requested.&#10;&#10;### Transition Sentence&#10;Once the recourse process in Process A concludes—either through successful payment collection or the forwarding of the case to a collection agency—the final financial status determines the issuance of the client invoice, triggering the weekly payment and monthly invoicing cycle described in Process B.&#10;&#10;***&#10;&#10;### Integrated Business Process Design: Vendor Payment, Client Invoicing, and Archiving&#10;&#10;**Process Objective:** To streamline the flow of financial transactions from vendor disbursement to client billing and final record keeping, ensuring accurate payment status validation at every stage.&#10;&#10;**Key Roles:**&#10;*   **Payment Office:** Executes financial disbursements and generates payment reports.&#10;*   **Vendor:** The recipient of payments.&#10;*   **Clients:** The entities being billed for services.&#10;*   **Registry Office:** Manages physical archiving and payment tracking.&#10;*   **Accounts Receivable Department (AR):** Handles client invoicing and revenue collection.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;#### **Process Flow**&#10;&#10;**Step 1: Vendor Payment (Weekly Cycle)**&#10;*   **Actor:** Payment Office&#10;*   **Action:** At the end of every week, the Payment Office generates a **Payment Report** and executes the payment to the **Vendor**.&#10;*   **Output:** The Payment Office sends the Payment Report (along with the payment invoice) automatically to the Client, the Registry Office, and the Accounts Receivable Department.&#10;&#10;**Step 2: Invoice Generation (Monthly Cycle)**&#10;*   **Actor:** Accounts Receivable Department (AR)&#10;*   **Action:** Upon receiving the Payment Report, AR generates a monthly invoice for the Client.&#10;*   **Action:** AR charges a fixed fee of $35 per invoice and notifies the Client of the total amount due.&#10;&#10;**Step 3: Decision Point – Invoice Payment Status**&#10;*   **Question:** Has the Client paid the invoice?&#10;    *   **Path A (Unpaid):** If the invoice remains unpaid, the process halts at AR for collection activities (escalation or follow-up).&#10;    *   **Path B (Paid):** If the invoice is paid, the process moves to the Registry Office for final processing.&#10;&#10;**Step 4: Archiving and Tracking**&#10;*   **Actor:** Registry Office&#10;*   **Action:** The Registry Office receives the payment status confirmation.&#10;*   **Action:** They select the paper-based invoices that have been paid.&#10;*   **Action:** Invoices are archived by **Vendor** first, then by **Payment Data** (date/amount).&#10;*   **Action:** The Registry Office tracks down the payment history to ensure the physical record matches the digital transaction.&#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;#### **Visual Process Summary (Text-Based Diagram)**&#10;&#10;```text&#10;[Payment Office]&#10;      |&#10;      | (Weekly)&#10;      v&#10;[Generate Payment Report &amp; Pay Vendor]&#10;      |&#10;      +-----------------------+-----------------------+&#10;      | (Send Report to Clients, Registry, AR)        |&#10;      |                                               |&#10;[Accounts Receivable Dept]                     [Registry Office]&#10;      |                                               |&#10;      | (Monthly)                                     | (Upon Payment Confirmation)&#10;      v                                               |&#10;[Generate Client Invoice]                             |&#10;      |                                               |&#10;      +-----------------------+                       |&#10;      | (Add $35 Fee)         |                       |&#10;      |                       |                       |&#10;[Notify Client]              |                       |&#10;      |                       |                       |&#10;      v                       |                       |&#10;[Decision: Invoice Paid?] --No--&gt; [Hold/Collection]  |&#10;      |                                               |&#10;     Yes                                              |&#10;      |                                               |&#10;      +-----------------------------------------------+&#10;      |&#10;[Update Payment Status]&#10;      |&#10;      v&#10;[Select Paper-Based Invoices]&#10;      |&#10;      v&#10;[Archive per Vendor &amp; Payment Data]&#10;      |&#10;      v&#10;[Track Payment] --&gt; [End of Process]&#10;```" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_4" sourceRef="atom_3_Task_9" targetRef="Bridge_4_ae26" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_4" sourceRef="Bridge_4_ae26" targetRef="atom_4_sid-A5093785-9337-44F9-BA57-6837E2F0DA1B" /><bpmn:task id="atom_5_Task_1" name="Implement plan">
